                  'Amount',
                  style: TextStyle(fontSize: 10, fontWeight: FontWeight.w700),
                ),
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ),

        const SizedBox(height: 16),

        // ================= DATA =================
        ...List.generate(10, (rangeIndex) {
          int qty = 0;
          double amt = 0.0;

          for (final entry in selections.entries) {
            final int number = entry.key;
            final int numberQty = entry.value;

            final int r = (number % 1000) ~/ 100;

            if (r == rangeIndex) {
              qty += numberQty;

              if (controller.model.high) {
                amt +=
                    numberQty *
                    controller.model.selectedPoint *
                    multipliers[rangeIndex];
              } else {
                amt += numberQty * controller.model.selectedPoint;
              }
            }
          }

          // ✅ APPLY SLOT MULTIPLIER TO BOTH
          final int finalQty = qty * slotMultiplier;
          final double finalAmt = amt * slotMultiplier;

          return Padding(
            padding: const EdgeInsets.all(8.0),
            child: Row(
              children: [
                Container(
                  width: BettingGridModel.cellW,
                  height: BettingGridModel.cellH - 12,
                  alignment: Alignment.center,
                  color: const Color.fromRGBO(52, 73, 95, 1),
                  child: Text(
                    finalQty.toString(),
                    style: const TextStyle(
                      fontSize: 11,
                      fontWeight: FontWeight.w600,
                      color: Colors.white,
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
                const SizedBox(width: 4),
                Container(
                  width: BettingGridModel.cellW,
                  height: BettingGridModel.cellH - 16,
                  alignment: Alignment.center,
                  color: const Color.fromRGBO(232, 206, 138, 1),
                  child: Text(
                    finalAmt.toStringAsFixed(0),
                    style: const TextStyle(
                      fontSize: 11,
                      fontWeight: FontWeight.w600,
                      color: Colors.white,
                    ),
                  ),
                ),
              ],
            ),
